        {
          "dimension": "Market / gap risk",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "24/7 perpetual trading of assets that only price during TradFi hours (equities, commodities) creates gap-open risk on Monday opens and after macro shocks when underlying spot markets are closed but the perp continues trading.",
